# AgriConnect Mobile - Environment Configuration
# Copy to .env.local and adjust values for your environment.
# Note: EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are inlined at build time.

# Base URL for the AgriConnect API.
# Optional: when unset, the app auto-detects the dev machine (the Metro host)
# and falls back to http://localhost:8000/api/v1 (or 10.0.2.2 on Android).
# Only set this when you need to point the app at a specific server:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://<your-ip-or-server>:8000/api/v1